<!--
  Civilopedia entries for Cultural Diffusion: a dedicated "Cultural Diffusion" section organised into page groups,
  plus one bridge page in the base game's Game Concepts > Settlements group so a player browsing the base rules
  finds the mod. Loaded through the modinfo <UpdateDatabase> in the game-scope ActionGroup; the text lives in
  text/en_us/PediaText.xml.

  Every page uses its own layout and NO CivilopediaPageChapterParagraphs rows: the pedia resolves each chapter's
  title and paragraphs by key convention (base-standard ui/civilopedia/model-civilopedia.js findChapterTextKey),
  LOC_PEDIA_<section>_PAGE_<page>_CHAPTER_<chapter>_TITLE and ..._PARA_1, _PARA_2, ... until the first gap. A
  chapter with no PARA_1 is skipped; a chapter with no TITLE row draws untitled (each page's CONTENT opening).
  tests/pedia-pages.mjs walks this file the way the engine does and fails on a page that would draw blank.

  Page ids carry a CD_ prefix because the pedia's search (open-civilopedia, the search box) matches a bare page id
  across every section, and OVERVIEW / OPTIONS / ABOUT already exist in other mods.

  CivilopediaPageLayouts must come before CivilopediaPages and CivilopediaPageLayoutChapters in this file: both
  have a real foreign key onto it and the loader inserts in document order.
-->
